cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite the archived release."
title: "Lifespan variation and premature mortality from malignant CNS neoplasms in Europe: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a study of the effect of mortality from malignant central
  nervous system neoplasms (ICD-10 C70-C72) on life expectancy and life disparity across 28
  European countries, 2012-2018, and of the dependence of cross-country comparisons of years of
  life lost on the reference life table.
type: software
version: 1.1.0
